   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-repair">Close-up detail of cottage house corner with metal planks siding and roof with steel gutter rain system. Durability, professional construction, drainage pipes installation and connection concept.</rdf:li>
